4. Ideas and lists, not code

   - The list of the short spellings of PowerShell's -EncodedCommand in rule DET-004 follows the list published by
     TrustedSec. It was not independently tested on a live host.
   - The Sigma files in sigma/ follow the Sigma rule format (https://sigmahq.io). The Splunk and Microsoft Sentinel
     queries in sigma/queries/ were made from them with pySigma and its Splunk and Kusto backends. Those tools were
     used to make the files and are not included here.
   - The web page was scanned for accessibility problems with axe-core. That tool was used to check the page and is
     not included here.
